-reply-position-2 even post-214697 reply type-reply status-publish hentry\">\n<div class=\"bbp-reply-author\">\n<a class=\"bbp-author-link\" href=\"https://www.rogerdeakins.com/forums/users/magyandras/\" title=\"View magyandras's profile\"><span class=\"bbp-author-avatar\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"avatar avatar-80 photo\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"80\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/f2a0df185ef69f2394165f0ec818b620?s=80&amp;d=retro&amp;r=g\" srcset=\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/f2a0df185ef69f2394165f0ec818b620?s=160&amp;d=retro&amp;r=g 2x\" width=\"80\"/></span><span class=\"bbp-author-name\">magyandras</span></a><div class=\"bbp-author-role\"><div class=\"\">Participant</div></div>\n<div class=\"tc_display\"><ul></ul></div>\n</div><!-- .bbp-reply-author -->\n<div class=\"bbp-reply-content\">\n<p>Hello! Is there a timeline or schedule for the tour, for example for Dallas on when/where it would be?</p>\n<p>Also, are there any plans to take the tour to Toronto, Ontario, Canada?</p>\n<p>Thank you!</p>\n</div><!-- .bbp-reply-content -->\n</div> .reply",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The ‘Byways’ experience has already been a great success and inspirational for us. We hope to continue with similar events as the one at Deborah’s gallery. Our next will take place in Dallas."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Hello! Is there a timeline or schedule for the tour, for example for Dallas on when/where it would be?"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Also, are there any plans to take the tour to Toronto, Ontario, Canada?"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Thank you!"
    }
